 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Stylistic precision through formal collocations",
     "texto": [
      "At the cultivated B2.2 register, simple verbs are replaced by formal collocations of great stylistic prestige:",
      "1. **eine Entscheidung treffen** (instead of *entscheiden*): to take or adopt a well-founded decision.",
      "2. **Verantwortung tragen / übernehmen** (instead of *verantwortlich sein*): to assume or bear responsibility.",
      "3. **unter Beweis stellen** (instead of *beweisen*): to test, to demonstrate conclusively a quality.",
      "4. **zur Debatte stehen** (instead of *diskutiert werden*): to be under debate, to be the object of deliberation.",
      "Mastering these formulas is a key marker of linguistic maturity in cultural debates."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Fixed collocation",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Equivalent simple verb",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Formal meaning",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
